      </div>
      <div class="faq-layout">
      <div class="faq reveal">
        <details><summary>Can I sell data my customers created?</summary><p>It depends on your contracts and the tool's terms. The data buyer reviews this before any buyer sees the data.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Is anonymised data safe to share?</summary><p>Removing names does not make data anonymous. Personal information gets its own review.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How much could my data be worth?</summary><p>We do not publish prices, because value depends on the data, the rights and the terms. We discuss it on a call.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What fees apply?</summary><p>Fees are agreed in writing before any deal moves forward.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How long does it take?</summary><p>It depends on the data and the rights review. We tell you the likely steps on the first call.</p></details>
